": "474009487932966", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035330_474009491266299_1456643477844227164_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MaWo2-OA2kQ7kNvwFWsTf7&_nc_oc=AdkBp7Nn0Fw0J5-VS8YU-dKSJiGAhwfrU87k0E6R_JFKAMkyC3GQqpYR2oh4I4rwgf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQKiOin6MoSZQg39nczbviqjY2dBQwgu8yhgiPv5gCKQ&oe=699D9D04"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "479919230355261", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75604733_479919237021927_3270815822813629402_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3t1URUQw7cEQ7kNvwH-GP3b&_nc_oc=AdlV3Hav7U1VZOcR4TTuBXu4heBsA1FKbqXibwKN-mvWYgGN7r0SUz-0r-CEWSpqmLk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftq9O8mayf061a2rOzUwAA-4kN84RCR3_dQyPb7tQnwnw&oe=699DA552"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "587095653146814", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035330_587095656480147_1944626692418926411_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nxkw1rt_Xp0Q7kNvwEzl1hK&_nc_oc=Adl1f6bOunyI19lxezBG73LAWCpLjZWLLvlcez-80_YzfkYDhv828Crnl6F_6_7MhUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvL3_1udtlu-xR3x0LeSstGB9lBtR_HxH2XEJGwm-ZQNQ&oe=699DA385"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "1279312729273224", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031422_1279312735939890_4968861642343199335_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XEW-0jnDq6gQ7kNvwG8di0c&_nc_oc=Adky82wqyIT3-K9MuApyHRuVso8gipomLYxkwMWT3M6rO3VxfQ9F2tJ2FVRNy0L5tas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsULXK6H0cq0QgvCcEeu2cTYnwgS1o1eKQSrMqqpSZ_fg&oe=699DB7A2"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a basalt canyon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a basalt canyon, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 800m long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a basalt canyon, which was computed by photogrammetry from a cubemap video (4096x1344x2) taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Gopro Max) and by walking about 800 meters.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "20131656